   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Level of institutionalization of the BIOFIN process in BIOFIN countries&apos; organizational frameworks</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scores to be assigned, based on Figure 7.2 (Levels of Institutionalization for the BIOFIN Process in a Country&#x2019;s Organizational Framework) in the BIOFIN Workbook 2018:
1 - Focal points (i.e., biodiversity finance focal points designated)
2 - Inter-Ministerial Coordination Framework
3 - Biodiversity finance staff in finance and/or environment ministries
4 - Changes in organizational structure, mandates
5 - Biodiversity Finance Unit in place
6 - Biodiversity finance curricula in civil service training/academic institutes

May be updated to reflect updates in the planned 2022 BIOFIN Workbook and then more fleshed out descriptions to be developed by BIOFIN global team in line with country experience and input from country teams.</narrative>
    </description>
